<title>USA: CIBCR U.S. leading inflation index 104.7 in June.</title>
<headline>CIBCR U.S. leading inflation index 104.7 in June.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Center for International Business Cycle Research (CIBCR) said its U.S. leading inflation index (LII) fell to 104.7 in June from a revised 105.2 in May.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
